<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-chenshu" book-id="b-chenshu-008" chapter-id="c-chenshu-008-zhouwenyu-born-and-adopted-names" source-id="s-chenshu-008-zhouwenyu-born-and-adopted-names-ws1750028">
  <p id="c-chenshu-008-zhouwenyu-born-and-adopted-names:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-chenshu-008-zhouwenyu-born-and-adopted-names:p001:m0000" ref="cea_x1n_2b8">周文育</persName>字<persName id="c-chenshu-008-zhouwenyu-born-and-adopted-names:p001:m0004" ref="cea_x1n_2b8">景德</persName>，義興陽羨人也。少孤貧，本居新安壽昌縣，姓項氏，名<persName id="c-chenshu-008-zhouwenyu-born-and-adopted-names:p001:m0031" ref="cea_x1n_2b8">猛奴</persName>。</p>
  <p id="c-chenshu-008-zhouwenyu-born-and-adopted-names:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">義興人<persName id="c-chenshu-008-zhouwenyu-born-and-adopted-names:p002:m0003" ref="p30_vie_xvb">周薈</persName>為壽昌浦口戍主，見而奇之，因召與語。</p>
  <p id="c-chenshu-008-zhouwenyu-born-and-adopted-names:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-chenshu-008-zhouwenyu-born-and-adopted-names:p003:m0000" ref="p30_vie_xvb">薈</persName>哀之，乃隨<persName id="c-chenshu-008-zhouwenyu-born-and-adopted-names:p003:m0006" ref="cea_x1n_2b8">文育</persName>至家，就其母請<persName id="c-chenshu-008-zhouwenyu-born-and-adopted-names:p003:m0015" ref="cea_x1n_2b8">文育</persName>養為己子，母遂與之。</p>
</text>
